OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	The Eight Thrones
Description	Eight keepers around one crossroads, generated by every symmetry of the square, so all eight starts are the same ground. 8 players. Somewhere in the rock, veterans of an old hero company camp in ruins, sitting on the gold they took with them.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

